  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Strategic performance and valuation memo</h2><p>Prepare an enterprise-to-equity bridge and identify performance-management implications.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs6-f1\">Enterprise value</label><input id=\"bar-m1-tbs6-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs6-f2\">Equity value</label><input id=\"bar-m1-tbs6-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs6-f3\">Improve the shipment incentive</label><select id=\"bar-m1-tbs6-f3\"><option value=\"Include quality and customer-outcome measures aligned with strategy\">Include quality and customer-outcome measures aligned with strategy</option><option value=\"Ignore returns\">Ignore returns</option><option value=\"Reward volume regardless of consequences\">Reward volume regardless of consequences</option><option value=\"Remove all performance monitoring\">Remove all performance monitoring</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs6-f4\">Response to supplier risk</label><select id=\"bar-m1-tbs6-f4\"><option value=\"Assess business effects, response options, and monitoring\">Assess business effects, response options, and monitoring</option><option value=\"Ignore all nonfinancial risk\">Ignore all nonfinancial risk</option><option value=\"Assume risk identification is the entire process\">Assume risk identification is the entire process</option><option value=\"Increase the valuation multiple automatically\">Increase the valuation multiple automatically</option></select></div></section>",
